# Spectacular Tactics, first mode: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains hexproof until end of turn."
# Bot1 casts it on its Memnite: it is a 2/2 with hexproof (CR 122.1, 702.11) until the turn ends. Bot2's Memnite is no target
# for this mode (it says "you control").

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Spectacular Tactics
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spectacular Tactics.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
